205
00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:28.940
<v Luca Rossi>So we will always try to create the best content and the best community for doing that.

206
00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.380
<v Luca Rossi>And that's really the goal and the vision.

207
00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:37.100
<v Luca Rossi>So I remember when people asked me the question, I mean, what's the future?

208
00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:37.760
<v Luca Rossi>What's the plan?

209
00:17:37.840 --> 00:17:45.940
<v Luca Rossi>When I was a founder and CTO of a regular VC-backed startup and we had our business plans, our five years plan.

