00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:13.400
<v Luca Rossi>to what we care about and we'll try, you know, to create things sustainable for us. Going back to

215
00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:18.400
<v Luca Rossi>to what you mentioned about activities that scale, activities that don't scale, but always

216
00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:23.840
<v Luca Rossi>trying to stay true to what we have been doing so far and trying to think what we would like

217
00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:29.040
<v Luca Rossi>to have and to consume and to use as a product for engineering leaders.

218
00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:32.440
<v Noah Labhart>Well, Luca, let's switch to you.

219
00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.140
<v Noah Labhart>Who influences the way that you work?

