00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:14.580
<v Luca Rossi>the quality bar of my expectations,

244
00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:20.560
<v Luca Rossi>but just to be less afraid and publish more articles from the get-go.

245
00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:24.260
<v Luca Rossi>One thing that I've learned is that on the internet,

246
00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:26.400
<v Luca Rossi>people are really overwhelmed with content.

247
00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:32.580
<v Luca Rossi>It's hard for a newsletter to take off sometimes because people just forget about you.

